<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφθάνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outrun, anticipate</i>, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφθάσασα καρδία γλῶσσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1028
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγὼ . . σε προφθάσας λέγω . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					500a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				520.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προὔφθης με παρακύψασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					884
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				20.25
			</span></i>, al.: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προέφθασα τοῦ
			φυγεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Jn.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>to
				be beforehand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1385
				</span></i>
			, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.160H.
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφθάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.913
				</span></i>
			.</div>
